Upstream inspiration:
Context and Seed are fresh implementations for ComfyUI's V3 node API,
inspired by the Context Big and Seed nodes in rgthree-comfy by
Regis Gaughan, III (rgthree).
No upstream source code is incorporated.

Upstream project: https://github.com/rgthree/rgthree-comfy

ImageSaverMini is a fresh implementation for ComfyUI's V3 node API,
inspired by ComfyUI-Image-Saver by alexopus, forked from
comfy-image-saver by Girish Gopaul (giriss), licensed under MIT.
Its filename conventions and generation metadata formats informed this
implementation. No upstream source code is incorporated.

Upstream projects:
https://github.com/alexopus/ComfyUI-Image-Saver
https://github.com/giriss/comfy-image-saver

